{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wheel World, where the fate of the universe rests on your handlebars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kat, a young cyclist with one mission: save Wheel World from total collapse. Explore a stunning open world filled with impressive vistas, hidden secrets, and races that will test your skills. Customize your bike with an endless array of parts, from sleek speedsters to off-road beasts\u2014there's no limit to how you can ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wheel World is packed with things to do:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race and Dominate:</strong> Take on elite cycling teams and quirky rivals in high-stakes races where every second counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ride:</strong> Scour the world for rare parts to build the ultimate bike, perfectly tailored to your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry Out Your Destiny:</strong> Recover your stolen Legendary parts to ultimately perform The Great Shift ritual and save the world. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is backed by an original soundtrack from <i>Italians Do It Better</i>, pumping energy into every race and moments of breathtaking semi-open world exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to pedal your way to glory, save the spirits of Wheel World, and keep the universe on track. Hop on, ride fast, and don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Kid on the Block","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/c27e8f78aba948d2afb93b56fde13c95c05f89b8.jpg"},{"name":"Turning Heads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/d48d8146a3d681f0e66621752e1a13ac25930107.jpg"},{"name":"Known Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/ddeec6a589d5d046f58bf75475cf248d30f0a17c.jpg"},{"name":"Living Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/be06e4a83b8c9f9a53ca7a2fa2bf0a51b750260e.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Bike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/fb463fee3e1b6f4e99225c44af075ce643c68104.jpg"},{"name":"Mark I Gigabike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/0fe3c9c2bc451cb38ec08cb341827821c3975d75.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/c758d739f409e2dcdb9cb7709a739e2bf5b7177b.jpg"},{"name":"Scattered Flock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/454001b78699ad6fb4dc23355fa4a829f812663e.jpg"},{"name":"New Bike Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/c44fb68d6c81ebb856f99b243e7de307306e0b74.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1497460/16943172a2a9f7bd895ad12bde84060022668b3f.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1497460?t=1768505155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768505155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/e9219382403d75be0d182f03bbb10ac8726cd35b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768505155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/e9219382403d75be0d182f03bbb10ac8726cd35b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768505155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/d08e0902c70f4992a3948a2f1e045d8b.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wheel World, where the fate of the universe rests on your handlebars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kat, a young cyclist with one mission: save Wheel World from total collapse. Explore a stunning open world filled with impressive vistas, hidden secrets, and races that will test your skills. Customize your bike with an endless array of parts, from sleek speedsters to off-road beasts\u2014there's no limit to how you can ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/9bbc9ee756c1496be3df28585ce5ef20.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wheel World is packed with things to do:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race and Dominate:</strong> Take on elite cycling teams and quirky rivals in high-stakes races where every second counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ride:</strong> Scour the world for rare parts to build the ultimate bike, perfectly tailored to your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry Out Your Destiny:</strong> Recover your stolen Legendary parts to ultimately perform The Great Shift ritual and save the world. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is backed by an original soundtrack from <i>Italians Do It Better</i>, pumping energy into every race and moments of breathtaking semi-open world exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to pedal your way to glory, save the spirits of Wheel World, and keep the universe on track. Hop on, ride fast, and don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.poster.avif?t=1768505155\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.webm?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/extras/4480c5624b050d5c17e9698d008ccdf7.mp4?t=1768505155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Messhof"],"dlc":[3842600],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497460/header.jpg?t=1768505155","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Messhof LLC. Published by Annapurna Interactive under exclusive license. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, U